{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"eff6b7f66f3cd57f4849c89bb0acf0e24bfff2ac7cbd968612c0ba1b446b658c","ja":"今日もみんなで……お花見です♪","zh":"今天也和大家一起……赏花♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1e0b488cca1174e5c444f1580b1f4cff28258815b4184a93ace22bc3e4141a5e","ja":"それじゃあみんな、持ってきたお弁当と\n飲み物を出してね！","zh":"那么大家，请把带来的便当和\n饮料拿出来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e8818e1bda370443743611c4d7fcae527e0597627830fdbec71d4b475c647d3d","ja":"オレたちもねっ！　へへっ、まさか\nステージでお弁当広げるなんてな～♪","zh":"我们也是！嘿嘿，真没想到\n居然会在舞台上打开便当呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9314992900dbba8c7f897180a894e273472560037906befe7b52263fb6a0331a","ja":"マス席を考えたのは、のり子！　で、食べ物を\n持ち寄るアイデアは、雪歩が出してくれたんだ！","zh":"升席是法子想出来的！然后，各自带食物\n过来的主意，则是雪步提出来的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8fe9a6c88815d8f70a850e04890ca2929f9ebb1e22bbb3951c9ac23a5015c9e2","ja":"みんな、初めましての人とも、\nわいわい楽しんじゃってね～！","zh":"大家，和初次见面的人也要\n一起热热闹闹地玩得开心哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"af0bf52d79109372c225bd633e908076703316651952232ef0d99d29ba24bd7a","ja":"えへへっ、みんなでお花見気分を味わえたら、\nすごくうれしいです！","zh":"嘿嘿，要是能和大家一起体验赏花的心情，\n我会非常开心的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"7c125dc4f6278a1b25ef34462ce560b287fa93e502c6ef09422c15d1f9be4d60","ja":"全員飲み物持った？　それじゃあいくよ？","zh":"大家饮料都拿好了吗？那么要开始啰？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1172.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"40f00c35b765d9d1be228277deb90ae00e5ab5bd4f65936e1e2d1c90e305b79f","ja":"せ～のっ！","zh":"预～备！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
